{"displayStem":"사구체 혈관극에 닿는 세뇨관과 들세동맥을 독립 모식도로 제시했다. X·Y가 가리키는 세포의 위치와 성격을 비교한다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 가상 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C05 c05-batch\"><div class=\"evidence c05-figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 620 360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"독립 제작 구조 모식도\"><rect width=\"620\" height=\"360\" fill=\"white\"></rect><g font-family=\"Noto Sans CJK KR, sans-serif\" fill=\"black\"><ellipse cx=\"380\" cy=\"180\" rx=\"110\" ry=\"90\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></ellipse><text x=\"335\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"22\">사구체</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"20\">관 내강</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"75\" width=\"195\" height=\"80\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"215\" y=\"135\" width=\"12\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#ddd\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"229\" y=\"135\" width=\"12\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#ddd\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"243\" y=\"135\" width=\"12\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#ddd\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"257\" y=\"135\" width=\"12\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#ddd\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"271\" y=\"135\" width=\"12\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#ddd\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><text x=\"205\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"22\">X</text><path d=\"M70 200L280 200\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M70 230L280 230\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M100 215L245 215\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M245 215L235.99552897647322 219.3496553411123\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M245 215L235.99552897647322 210.6503446588877\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"20\">들세동맥</text><ellipse cx=\"220\" cy=\"194\" rx=\"8\" ry